Lab: Method-based access control can be circumvented
Now this one was odd because they gave you acces to an admin account for reference and I had to see the solution
The solution was to copy the admin's upgrade request (putting in your own cookie) and then changing the methord to an invalid on (such as "POSTX") to allow for a different error to show instead
The error shows was one asking for params. So after changing to a GET request and adding params into the URL then you can upgrade your permissions without an admin's cookies

